OL,5,G1930 EFL Carabao Cup Live
OL,6,     FManchester United v Brighton &
OL,7,     FHove Albion (Kick-off 8.00pm).
OL,8,     FMark Pougatch presents all the
OL,9,     Faction from the third-round tie at
OL,10,     FOld Trafford. United have won this
OL,11,     Ftrophy on six occasions, with the
OL,12,     Fmost recent of those triumphs
OL,13,     Fcoming in 2024. Although Brighton
OL,14,     Fhave established themselves in the
OL,15,     FPremier League over the past
OL,16,     Fdecade, a major trophy still
OL,17,     Fcontinues to elude them, with
OL,18,     Ftheir 1983 FA Cup final defeat at
OL,19,     Fthe hands of today's opponents
OL,20,     Fstill the closest they have come.
OL,21,     FWith commentary by Sam Matterface,
OL,22,     Fand pitchside reports from Gabriel
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/6
